sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Universal Search
  participant A as Presentation adapter
  participant S as SearchService
  participant R as Registry
  participant P as Providers
  UI->>A: query
  A->>S: normalized request
  S->>R: discover
  R->>P: parallel execution
  P-->>S: normalized results
  S-->>A: ranked result + diagnostics
  A-->>UI: existing view model
